<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voiced_glottal_fricative> has also been=20
suggested (maybe even used unconsciously) as a possible realization of=20
=E2=80=B9'=E2=80=BA. This sound exists in at least some dialects of English=
 as an=20
